    "detailed_description": "Click to Escape is a turn-based, action roguelite where you can freeze time to your advantage. Auto-fire as time moves, and use powerful situational weapons when time stops. Travel through different systems and upgrade your ship to escape the Swarm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241520/extras/4026fec503e7410d781a0eb083b68e77.poster.avif?t=1670948206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241520/extras/4026fec503e7410d781a0eb083b68e77.webm?t=1670948206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241520/extras/4026fec503e7410d781a0eb083b68e77.mp4?t=1670948206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><br>Exterminate.</strong><br>Blast your way through hordes of enemies as you level up your auto-firing weapons and unlock powerful situational weapons to overcome the toughest challenges.<br><br><strong>Explore.</strong><br>Navigate different systems in the galaxy and collect resources to upgrade your spaceship. Scan your map for biomes and resources such as fuel, scrap metal, and dark matter.<br><br><strong>Escape!</strong><br>Gather enough resources to jump to the next system before the deadly Swarm overwhelms and destroys the current system.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241520/extras/2982419deb400196ae7c8a0883554b54.avif?t=1670948206\" /></span>",
